From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apklayer <apklayer@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] InstrumentationConfiguration: acquire javax.microedition.khronos

apklayer patch: EGL's javax.microedition.khronos classes belong to Android (the framework jar), not the SDK stub jar, so the
sandbox acquires them (EGL10/GLImpl run Android's code, TextureView GL apps). Formerly a bytecode rewrite
(runtime/patches/apklayer/patches/SandboxLoaderPatch.java).

Against external/robolectric 87aa52b08 (REVISION). Applied by scripts/build-runtime-overlay.sh onto the staged
upstream sources (<native>/aosp/robolectric-src); the result is compiled into native-runtime.jar ahead of Robolectric_all.jar.
---
diff --git a/sandbox/src/main/java/org/robolectric/internal/bytecode/InstrumentationConfiguration.java b/sandbox/src/main/java/org/robolectric/internal/bytecode/InstrumentationConfiguration.java
--- a/sandbox/src/main/java/org/robolectric/internal/bytecode/InstrumentationConfiguration.java
+++ b/sandbox/src/main/java/org/robolectric/internal/bytecode/InstrumentationConfiguration.java
@@ -119,6 +119,10 @@
    * @return True if the class should be loaded.
    */
   public boolean shouldAcquire(String name) {
+    // apklayer patch: EGL's javax classes belong to Android (the framework jar), not the SDK stub jar
+    if (name.startsWith("javax.microedition.khronos.")) {
+      return true;
+    }
     if (CLASSES_TO_ALWAYS_ACQUIRE.contains(name)) {
       return true;
     }
